### Task 5.0b: LOCAL-CODER — write ExtendScript in the panel, run it immediately

**Files:** Create `cep-panel-ae/client/src/builder-coder.js` (shared by both coders), `tests/builder-coder.test.js`.

Both coders do the **same job**: given a shot spec plus the environment brief, emit ExtendScript that builds the comp. Same prompt, same docs. LOCAL-CODER goes straight to AE (your machine, your model); WEB-CODER arrives by git and passes the gate first.

